Files in Assignment folder:
    bill.csv → Input file with items, quantities, prices.
    bill_calculation.py → Script to process the bill.
    bill_summary.csv → Output file with totals and discounts.

What bill_calculation.py does:
    Reads data from bill.csv.
    Calculates total price for each item.
    Applies random discount (5–15%).
    Computes final bill after discount.
    Finds most expensive item after discount.
    Calculates grand total of all items.
    Saves results in bill_summary.csv.
    Prints results in aligned table format.

How to run:
    Open terminal inside Assignment/.
    all dependencies: pip install pandas numpy tabulate.

Run: python3 bill_calculation.py.

Output:
    Neatly formatted bill printed in terminal.
    bill_summary.csv with Item, Quantity, PricePerUnit, Total, Discount%, FinalBill.